    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4538986db22067255d16bcf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠只能利用短暂期间竭尽全力进行准备。\n同时她也没疏于收集信息，例如透过玩游戏\n调查竞争对手的思考倾向等等。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab98359e7fb5c31c67f2572395f9429855b9426b0bbea3a97a7d509fea7ad75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088411.json",
