    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb064cef5a7fcc7a01e49c43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而却没能收集到有关大鸣大放的信息。\n看来她似乎相当戒备，用心隐瞒着自己的情报。\n就这样到了竞赛当天──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68d10bfc6ddf1960f6b9cb12d4b4c8cb4ad2f2edc89590b1b3f7d603e0645ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
