    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de7f83028cfe38b56951ad69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛当天。曾于「皋月赏」\n展现其惊人尾段加速的大鸣大放，\n令其他参赛者们感受到沉重的压力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f136961f3ebcb8c07c51b22da958fd34caf889bed0240500c06a48c14831049",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25ac9c5833827a3020a7b226",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a759e9a6fbf943fa6981768",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而身处其中的里见皇冠则是静静地燃起斗志。\n为了与对方一战，她已做好所有准备。\n接着就只差专注地冲向胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eb217a1ec5c1db6b5fe2aa6e2b3e7f8b88b01e0b4bfb9886cae1b2efc01d0c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
