      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb359481227e6615bd908e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8a6e3ea7fcd7a858856493",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠即将参战「菊花赏」。\n她鼓起干劲，打算连同因骨折而无法参赛的\n大鸣大放的份一起努力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc97a714927183e52a7941e2debf2b707074fe12d41798cb54f8c6a8b0376cac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad42bb6f66b588d4e8b42446",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3598dbf650fef6118ad10c64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但北部玄驹也不打算认输。\n一定要成为肩负众人期待的巨星──\n她带着这份决心跟同伴们一起完成了严苛的修行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c54f16c17e038f877ae92b651840267457b5a16112e787a97bfbc5960f67b0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
