      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73cc52244ef12dc5156995d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠从北部玄驹身上感受到\n非同小可的气势。波涛汹涌的\n「菊花赏」此刻就要开幕──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbcf67ba6b423fc660f0652907159c371e2d6210b85402a5b3c217ced1d0f565",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877493bf5a23cecae1aafa5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
