      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹承诺要打倒所有竞争对手，\n荣登今年的主角。\n而里见皇冠也有相同打算。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18081a8d71baccd474fa7abb2b2317778472a236a53046cfadc72e5f50d0dc4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
