      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众人都在为了「宝冢纪念」加紧准备。\n竞争对手们的脚力皆调整得趋近完美……\n但她的分析信息也没有任何遗漏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84642d65520734625d2934c24880c21436d6790b41fd3560bcb4b4afd08f1fb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
