      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连在「天皇赏（春）」\n大展身手的高尚骏逸，\n都已被里见皇冠分析完毕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97649bfcb29ef24fe134b0934ca4677325db0a6196efb59dc912f3c34db4300e",
